            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A system and method for measuring blood content are provided. The system comprises a color imaging system (120) configured to acquire color images (110), an infrared imaging system configured to acquire infrared images (102), and a processor (100). The processor (100) is configured to: identify a surgical textile shape using the infrared images, generate shape information from the infrared images, use the shape information to identify surgical textile pixels in the color images (110), and extract blood information from the surgical textile pixels. The processor (100) is further configured to transform the shape information of the infrared images to a coordinate system corresponding to the color images.</p>
            </abstract>
